</span></div></td>
<td id="S4.T3.6.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:0.0pt;padding-right:0.0pt;"><span id="S4.T3.6.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_align_top">
