<div id="A7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Note that TTAdapt method is not implemented for Ovis2 and InternVL model families due to practical constraints; the Unsloth library does not currently support those model families yet.</p>
