<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span><span id="A7.F7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Performance improvements across different models.</span> Each point
represents a different model-strategy pair; x-axis shows model parameter
size (B) using <span id="A7.F7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">asinh</span> scaling, and y-axis shows accuracy (%).</figcaption>
